                "series s2 (Poor Metabolizers, fill #ff7f4f)"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "attributes": [
            "dom_index"
          ],
          "semantics": "Within g.chart, the three bar series are drawn in DOM order s0 (Extensive), then s1 (Intermediate), then s2 (Poor). Later DOM elements render on top of earlier ones. IF bars are repositioned or chart design changes such that bars from different series overlap in screen space (e.g., due to negative values or different grouping), THEN any series intended to appear on top (for emphasis or to avoid occlusion) MUST be placed later in the DOM order. Changing series stacking semantics therefore requires reordering the <g class='series sX'> groups in the SVG."
        }
      ]
